      "label": "1",
      "translit": [
        "choḍato puruṣa-abhimān",
        "kiṅkorī hoiluṅ āji, kān!"
      ],
      "translation": "I give up the vanity of the error that I am a male. Today I have become Your faithful maidservant, O Kāna!",
      "deva": [
        "छोडतो पुरुष-अभिमान्",
        "किङ्कोरी होइलुङ् आजि, कान्!"
      ],
      "bengali": [
        "ছোডতো পুরুষ-অভিমান্",
        "কিঙ্কোরী হোইলুঙ্ আজি, কান্!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "2",
      "translit": [
        "baraja-bipine sakhī-sāth",
        "sevana korobuṅ, rādhā-nāth!"
      ],
      "translation": "In the groves of Vraja I will render personal service as a follower of one of the confidential sakhīs, O Lord of Rādhā!",
      "deva": [
        "बरज-बिपिने सखी-साथ्",
        "सेवन कोरोबुङ्, राधा-नाथ्!"
      ],
      "bengali": [
        "বরজ-বিপিনে সখী-সাথ্",
        "সেবন কোরোবুঙ্, রাধা-নাথ্!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "3",
      "translit": [
        "kusume gāṅthobuṅ hār",
        "tulasī-maṇi-mañjarī tār"
      ],
      "translation": "I will string together a garland of forest flowers, in which tulasī buds shall be the jewelled pendants.",
      "deva": [
        "कुसुमे गाङ्थोबुङ् हार्",
        "तुलसी-मणि-मञ्जरी तार्"
      ],
      "bengali": [
        "কুসুমে গাঙ্থোবুঙ্ হার্",
        "তুলসী-মণি-মঞ্জরী তার্"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "4",
      "translit": [
        "jatane deobuṅ sakhī-kare",
        "hāte laobo sakhī ādare"
      ],
      "translation": "With utmost care I will place the garland in the hands of my superior sakhī, and she will take it out of my hands with loving regard.",
      "deva": [
        "जतने देओबुङ् सखी-करे",
        "हाते लओबो सखी आदरे"
      ],
      "bengali": [
        "জতনে দেওবুঙ্ সখী-করে",
        "হাতে লওবো সখী আদরে"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "5",
      "translit": [
        "sakhī dibo tuwā duhuk gale",
        "dūrato herobuṅ kutūhale"
      ],
      "translation": "Then she will place the garland around both of Your necks, while from afar I watch in wonder.",
      "deva": [
        "सखी दिबो तुवा दुहुक् गले",
        "दूरतो हेरोबुङ् कुतूहले"
      ],
      "bengali": [
        "সখী দিবো তুবা দুহুক্ গলে",
        "দূরতো হেরোবুঙ্ কুতূহলে"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "6",
      "translit": [
        "sakhī kahabo,-“śuno sundarī!",
        "rahobi kuñje mama kiṅkorī"
      ],
      "translation": "The confidante will then say to me, “Listen, O beautiful one, you shall remain in this grove as my attendant.",
      "deva": [
        "सखी कहबो,-“शुनो सुन्दरी!",
        "रहोबि कुञ्जे मम किङ्कोरी"
      ],
      "bengali": [
        "সখী কহবো,-“শুনো সুন্দরী!",
        "রহোবি কুঞ্জে মম কিঙ্কোরী"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "7",
      "translit": [
        "gāṅthobi mālā mano-hārinī",
        "niti rādhā-kṛṣṇa-vimohinī"
      ],
      "translation": "“Daily you will string together beautiful flower garlands that will enchant Rādhā and Kṛṣṇa.",
      "deva": [
        "गाङ्थोबि माला मनो-हारिनी",
        "निति राधा-कृष्ण-विमोहिनी"
      ],
      "bengali": [
        "গাঙ্থোবি মালা মনো-হারিনী",
        "নিতি রাধা-কৃষ্ণ-বিমোহিনী"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "8",
      "translit": [
        "tuwā rakhana-bhāra hāmārā",
        "mama kuñja-kuṭīra tohārā"
      ],
      "translation": "“The responsibility for your maintenance is mine. My cottage in this grove is yours.",
      "deva": [
        "तुवा रखन-भार हामारा",
        "मम कुञ्ज-कुटीर तोहारा"
      ],
      "bengali": [
        "তুবা রখন-ভার হামারা",
        "মম কুঞ্জ-কুটীর তোহারা"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "9",
      "translit": [
        "rādhā-mādhava-sevana-kāle",
        "rahobi hāmāra antarāle"
      ],
      "translation": "“When the time comes for me to go and serve Rādhā and Mādhava, you will stay close to me while remaining hidden.",
      "deva": [
        "राधा-माधव-सेवन-काले",
        "रहोबि हामार अन्तराले"
      ],
      "bengali": [
        "রাধা-মাধব-সেবন-কালে",
        "রহোবি হামার অন্তরালে"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "10",
      "translit": [
        "tāmbula sāji’ karpūra āni’",
        "deobi moe āpana jāni’ “"
      ],
      "translation": "“After dressing packets of betel nuts and fetching the camphor, you will hand them to me, knowing me to be your very own.”",
      "deva": [
        "ताम्बुल साजि’ कर्पूर आनि’",
        "देओबि मोए आपन जानि’ “"
      ],
      "bengali": [
        "তাম্বুল সাজি’ কর্পূর আনি’",
        "দেওবি মোএ আপন জানি’ “"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "11",
      "translit": [
        "bhakativinoda śuni’ bāt",
        "sakhī-pade kare pranipāt"
      ],
      "translation": "Bhaktivinoda, having heard all these instructions, bows down at the lotus feet of that confidential sakhī.",
      "deva": [
        "भकतिविनोद शुनि’ बात्",
        "सखी-पदे करे प्रनिपात्"
      ],
      "bengali": [
        "ভকতিবিনোদ শুনি’ বাত্",
        "সখী-পদে করে প্রনিপাত্"
      ]
    }
